<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia February C/A deficit at $23 million.</title>
<headline>Slovenia February C/A deficit at $23 million.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>					Feb    Jan    Feb 96</p>
<p> Current account balance	-23.0  +31.9  -9.6</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -96    -48    -88</p>
<p> Exports			    636    624    676</p>
<p> Imports			    732    672    765</p>
<p>(Differences due to rounding)</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-=8439</p>
</text>
